msgid "Tattu Plus DroneCAN Battery"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-tattu-dronecan-battery.rst:11
#: 972c17ec5c554cb89a0b93215704523e
msgid "Tattu Plus batteries with AS150U connectors support DroneCAN which allows the autopilot to retrieve the battery's total voltage, individual cell voltages, current, temperature and percentage of remaining capacity."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-tattu-dronecan-battery.rst:13
#: 35300ba5beb941b3a8abd311167ff88c
msgid "The contents of this page were verified using a Tattu Plus 1.0 battery with SKU:TAA16KP12S15C."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-tattu-dronecan-battery.rst:15
#: 77d24878c6a8489aab2c43a928c282ac
msgid "Some images courtesy of genstattu.com and 3dxr.co.uk"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-tattu-dronecan-battery.rst:18
#: 6d6d9fc636904e1a9066c41655b969be
msgid "Connection and Configuration"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-tattu-dronecan-battery.rst:20
#: f485083249594feb9656b20f3a2f1f7c
msgid "A female AS150U connector with leads should be used to connect the battery's signal wires to the autopilot's CAN port as shown below."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-tattu-dronecan-battery.rst:26
#: f48bfa8baf8748ae87320cf3fdae0e4f
msgid "Connect to the autopilot with a ground station and set the following parameters and then reboot the autopilot"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-tattu-dronecan-battery.rst:28
#: e874f41bcc094cac844879eafd236788
msgid "Set :ref:`CAN_P1_DRIVER<CAN_P1_DRIVER>` to 1 (First Driver)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-tattu-dronecan-battery.rst:29
#: bd7edfc78aab41d8861b6c713c4a6722
msgid "Set :ref:`CAN_D1_PROTOCOL<CAN_D1_PROTOCOL>` to 1 (DroneCAN)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-tattu-dronecan-battery.rst:30
#: 8dfa3224861641d2bf3afa05ff9a0f11
msgid "Set :ref:`BATT_MONITOR<BATT_MONITOR>` to 8 (DroneCAN)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-tattu-dronecan-battery.rst:33
#: 60c03509ebfd4ad2abafc2bdde603269
msgid "Connecting Multiple Batteries"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-tattu-dronecan-battery.rst:35
#: 5ea667cb27f94c41b8ce078623a0e2af
msgid "If more than one Tattu battery is connected, use MP's DroneCAN, MAVLink-CAN1 feature or the :ref:`DroneCAN GUI<common-uavcan-gui>` to set each battery's \"battery.id\" field to a unique number (e.g. 1 for the 1st battery, 2 for the 2nd battery)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-tattu-dronecan-battery.rst:41
#: 0825fb58ff0d4da8b96f04d5ef92f66b
msgid "On the autopilot, set the appropriate battery serial number parameter to match the above battery.id values"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-tattu-dronecan-battery.rst:43
#: 096c4faa2c4b4a37b093a0c76ebe50a9
msgid "Set :ref:`BATT_SERIAL_NUM<BATT_SERIAL_NUM>` to 1"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-tattu-dronecan-battery.rst:44
#: 97137a49f1ad42438f5bf85392e5e125
msgid "Set :ref:`BATT2_SERIAL_NUM<BATT2_SERIAL_NUM>` to 2"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-tattu-dronecan-battery.rst:46
#: a3002f89a674461e9c3a44fab2c2370c
msgid "To more easily see the average voltage and total current of multiple batteries a :ref:`\"Sum of Selected Monitors\" battery monitor <common-power-module-configuration-in-mission-planner>` can be configured."
msgstr ""

